{"id":"yellowjackets-tmdb-117488","type":"SERIES","category":"STREAMING","title":"Yellowjackets","overview":"Tras un accidente aéreo, un equipo de fútbol femenino se convierten en las (des)afortunadas supervivientes de una remota zona salvaje del norte, intentando vencer a la muerte. Pero años después, las sobrevivientes lidian el peso de sus terribles desiciones.","releaseDate":"2026-11-22","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRnGrn7Z7SC0KIBodocoU1QgDZF.jpg","backdropUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ibFWJDWS8cTO6s2vZVd2uKDm8p.jpg","genres":["Drama","Misterio"],"originalLanguage":"en","spokenLanguages":["English"],"images":[{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ibFWJDWS8cTO6s2vZVd2uKDm8p.jpg","label":"Escena 01"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3FVvYhS8lmS9UN3UxBc1Kj8OxLb.jpg","label":"Escena 02"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ihzMEmq7Yc6ZfgEhagdDKnhGBgX.jpg","label":"Escena 03"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/t9gfV0eM9nWqJ4vMey4CSYFiqmZ.jpg","label":"Escena 04"},{"url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/oD4caWrYVrC1KLyLBuyiNZJVSl0.jpg","label":"Escena 05"}],"ratings":{"tmdb":7.4},"availability":{"platforms":["Paramount Plus","Paramount+ Amazon Channel","Paramount Plus Apple TV channel","Paramount Plus Premium"],"networks":["Showtime","Paramount+ with Showtime"]},"saga":{"name":"Yellowjackets","items":[{"title":"Temporada 1","year":"2021","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XtnjzjjFAnmTEiDk4xu7diCvMF.jpg","overview":"Un equipo de exitosas jugadoras de fútbol de instituto pasan a ser las (des)afortunadas supervivientes de un accidente de avión que se estrella en la más profunda y salvaje naturaleza de Ontario.","rating":7.6,"extra":"10 episodios"},{"title":"Temporada 2","year":"2023","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o4Ql7oU2W3U8RyeDoSREDdKvTlq.jpg","overview":"En la segunda temporada, han pasado dos meses desde que Shauna le dio la espalda a Jackie, con resultados desastrosos. Frente a su creciente hambre y miedo, la tensión entre las Yellowjackets solo ha empeorado. Las duras condiciones del invierno se intensifican día a día, y la psiquis de las sobrevivientes se deteriora con la misma rapidez. Amenazadas por la oscuridad de la naturaleza, y los inquietantes recuerdos de ella en el presente, nuestras ex campeonas estatales se verán obligadas a tomar decisiones imposibles. Mientras enfrentan la horrible verdad de lo que implica la supervivencia, la verdadera pesadilla para cada uno de ellas será descubrir quiénes son y qué están dispuestos a sacrificar para mantenerse con vida.","rating":7.2,"extra":"9 episodios"},{"title":"Temporada 3","year":"2025","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agBOgS5q1QxvaiM8TDzNTnq2EIs.jpg","rating":7,"extra":"10 episodios"},{"title":"Temporada 4","year":"2026","posterUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gCQuqv4B6ymQPA0pmS1FP2CjwkC.jpg","extra":"1 episodios"}]},"cast":[{"name":"Melanie Lynskey","role":"Shauna Sadecki","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kzrWI1sTgnA0H7TCIKzDOUtOW4n.jpg","personTmdbId":15091,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":30},{"name":"Tawny Cypress","role":"Taissa Turner","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Ar9G1Uye2e2ZiTTiYrn1MutBis.jpg","personTmdbId":34066,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":30},{"name":"Sophie Nélisse","role":"Teen Shauna Shipman","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRznDS7CEKllld5wqxxUcaE0DWW.jpg","personTmdbId":1008607,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":30},{"name":"Jasmin Savoy Brown","role":"Teen Taissa Turner","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWaCA2iKmVps20SFxwiB1DvbN6j.jpg","personTmdbId":1508653,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":30},{"name":"Sophie Thatcher","role":"Teen Natalie Scatorccio","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7wB4ORCwPPz7H3dWVCNSAKQz9P.jpg","personTmdbId":1981044,"department":"Acting","episodeCount":30},{"name":"Sammi Hanratty","role":"Teen Misty Quigley","photoUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdNN4Xqm8